<!-- ═══ SECTION 3: GENDER DISPARITY ═══ -->
<h2 id="sex-disparity">3. Gender Disparity in Homicide Victimization</h2>

<p>One of the most striking features of global homicide patterns is the pronounced gender disparity. Men are far more likely to die by homicide than women in virtually every country and time period. The male-to-female homicide rate ratio is a critical KPI that quantifies this gap.</p>

<div class="kpi-grid" style="max-width:400px;">
    <div class="kpi-card highlight">
        <div class="kpi-value">{kpis['male_female_ratio']:.2f}:1</div>
